  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{否|ひ} (negate, reject) + {決|けつ} (decide) → deciding against\n\nVERB FORM:\n{否決|ひけつ}する (to vote down, to reject)\n\nANTONYM:\n{可決|かけつ} (passage, approval)\n\nCOLLOCATIONS:\n- {満場|まんじょう}{一致|いっち}で{否決|ひけつ} (rejected unanimously)\n- {否決|ひけつ}{権|けん} (veto power)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {却下|きゃっか} (rejection, dismissal)\n- {棄却|ききゃく} (dismissal, rejection)",
